#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:2
msgid "How to manage versions automatically"
msgstr "如何自动管理版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:4
msgid ""
"In this guide, we show you how to define rules to automate creation of new "
"versions on Read the Docs, using your Git repository's version logic. "
"Automating your versioning on Read the Docs means you only have to handle "
"your versioning logic in Git."
msgstr ""
"本指南讲解如何利用 Git 仓库的版本逻辑定义规则，在 Read the Docs 上自动创建新版本。在 Read the Docs "
"上自动化版本控制意味着你只需在 Git 中处理版本逻辑。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:11
msgid ":doc:`/versions`"
msgstr ":doc:`/versions`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:12
msgid "Learn more about versioning of documentation in general."
msgstr "进一步了解文档版本控制的通用知识。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:14
msgid ":doc:`/automation-rules`"
msgstr ":doc:`/automation-rules`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:15
msgid "Reference for all different rules and actions possible with automation."
msgstr "自动化中所有可用规则和动作的参考。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:18
msgid "Adding a new automation rule"
msgstr "添加新的自动化规则"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:20
msgid "First you need to go to the automation rule creation page:"
msgstr "首先需要前往自动化规则创建页面："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:22
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Automation rules`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Automation rules` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:23
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Add automation rule` and you will see the following form."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Add automation rule` ，你会看到以下表单。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:25
msgid "Screenshot of the \"Add rule\" form"
msgstr "\"添加规则\"表单截图"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:28
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Add rule` form, fill in the following fields:"
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`Add rule` 表单中填写以下字段："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:30
msgid ""
"Enter a :guilabel:`Description` that you can refer to later. For example, "
"entering \"Create new stable version\" is a good title, as it explains the "
"intention of the rule."
msgstr ""
"填写一个日后便于查阅的 :guilabel:`Description` 。例如\"Create new stable "
"version\"是不错的标题，因为它说明了规则的意图。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:34
msgid ""
"Choose one or more :guilabel:`Version types`: *Branch*, *Tag*, or *Pull "
"request*."
msgstr "选择一个或多个 :guilabel:`Version types` ：*Branch* 、*Tag* 或 *Pull request* 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:37
msgid ""
"Choose a :guilabel:`Version predefined match pattern`, which is the pattern "
"you wish to detect in the version name."
msgstr "选择 :guilabel:`Version predefined match pattern` ，即你希望在版本名中检测的模式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:40
msgid ":ref:`Any version <automation-rules:Predefined matches>` matches all values."
msgstr ":ref:`Any version <automation-rules:Predefined matches>` 匹配所有值。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:41
msgid ""
":ref:`SemVer versions <automation-rules:Predefined matches>` matches only "
"values that have the `SemVer`_ format."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SemVer versions <automation-rules:Predefined matches>` 只匹配符合 `SemVer`_"
" 格式的值。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:42
msgid ""
":ref:`Custom match <automation-rules:Custom matches>` matches your own "
"pattern. If you choose this option, enter a regular expression in `Python "
"regex format`_ in the :guilabel:`Version match pattern` field."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Custom match <automation-rules:Custom matches>` 匹配你自己的模式。若选择此选项，在 "
":guilabel:`Version match pattern` 字段中填入 `Python regex format`_ 格式的正则表达式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:46
msgid ""
"Optionally, fill in the webhook match patterns to only match on specific "
"files, pull request labels, or commit messages. See :ref:`automation-"
"rules:Webhook filters`."
msgstr ""
"可选：填写 Webhook 匹配模式，仅针对特定文件、Pull Request 标签或提交信息进行匹配。参见 :ref:`automation-"
"rules:Webhook filters` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:49
msgid "Finally, choose the :guilabel:`Action`:"
msgstr "最后，选择 :guilabel:`Action` ："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:51
msgid ":ref:`Activate version <automation-rules:Version actions>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Activate version <automation-rules:Version actions>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:52
msgid ":ref:`Hide version <automation-rules:Version actions>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Hide version <automation-rules:Version actions>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:53
msgid ":ref:`Make version public <automation-rules:Version actions>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Make version public <automation-rules:Version actions>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:54
msgid ":ref:`Make version private <automation-rules:Version actions>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Make version private <automation-rules:Version actions>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:55
msgid ":ref:`Set version as default <automation-rules:Version actions>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Set version as default <automation-rules:Version actions>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:56
msgid ":ref:`Delete version <automation-rules:Version actions>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Delete version <automation-rules:Version actions>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:57
msgid ":ref:`Trigger build for version <automation-rules:Build actions>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Trigger build for version <automation-rules:Build actions>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:60
msgid ""
"Now your rule is ready and you can press :guilabel:`Add rule`. The rule "
"takes effect immediately when a new version is created, but does not apply "
"to old versions."
msgstr "规则已就绪，可以点击 :guilabel:`Add rule` 。规则在创建新版本时立即生效，但不适用于旧版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:66
msgid "Examples of common usage"
msgstr "常见用法示例"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:67
msgid ""
"See :ref:`the list of examples <automation-rules:Examples>` for rules that "
"are commonly used."
msgstr "常用规则见 :ref:`示例列表 <automation-rules:Examples>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:69
msgid "Want to test if your rule works?"
msgstr "想测试你的规则是否生效？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:70
msgid ""
"If you are using Git in order to create new versions, create a Git tag or "
"branch that matches the rule and check if your automation action is "
"triggered. After the experiment, you can delete both from Git and Read the "
"Docs."
msgstr ""
"如果你用 Git 创建新版本，请创建一个匹配该规则的 Git 标签或分支，检查自动化动作是否被触发。实验结束后，你可以在 Git 和 Read the "
"Docs 上将其删除。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:79
msgid "Ordering your rules"
msgstr "规则排序"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:81
msgid ""
"The order your rules are listed in your project's :menuselection:`Settings "
"--> Automation rules` matters. Each action will be performed in that order, "
"so earlier rules have a higher priority."
msgstr ""
"规则在项目 :menuselection:`Settings --> Automation rules` "
"中的列出顺序很重要。每个动作将按该顺序执行，因此靠前的规则优先级更高。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:85
msgid "You can change the order using the up and down arrow buttons."
msgstr "你可以用上下箭头按钮更改顺序。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/automation-rules.rst:89
msgid ""
"New rules are added at the start of the list (i.e. they have the highest "
"priority)."
msgstr "新规则会添加到列表开头（即优先级最高）。"

